==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Plus One: Special}}

==Battleground==
*2 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Razorback]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**4 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Youcan]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**2 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Razorback]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a fairly normal Dark/Alien stage with Razorback and Youcan as the main enemies to watch out for. While there are UltraBaaBaas on the startoff, this stage is easy enough for you to not stack on anyways.

On base hit, you need to beat up a Razorback, then a Youcan, then another Razorback, then another Youcan again. The spawning intervals between them are fairly tight, so you want to rush them quickly. Killing Razorback is fairly easy given powerful anti-Darks like [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], who is fast and able to freeze his opponents, and [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]], whose DPS will melt through Razorback like a hot knife. Unfortunately, there aren't as many Special anti-Aliens that are actually good, so you'll have to break his Barrier then beat him up with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. Once the Youcan dies, the next Razorback will spawn, which you can also jump easily using the same method as before. The final Youcan won't be supported with much, so you can just take your time then beat the stage easily.

